<article data-id="welcome">
    <header>
        <h3>{{{i18n 'Welcome!'}}}</h3>
    </header>
    <div class="pad-wrapper">
        <p>{{{i18n 'Welcome to the pixel canvas! The site runs on an open-source repository, but this copy is hosted by me - Caffeine Lich (the link to the original repo is at the bottom).'}}}</p>
        <p>{{{i18n 'This site exists to out-flex magma and build a truly convenient pixel canvas. AND ALSO BECAUSE I HAVE ALWAYS WANTED TO SELF-HOST PROJECTS, AND THIS IS AN IMPORTANT EXPERIMENT FOR ME.'}}}</p>
        <p>{{{i18n 'Check out the Settings (top right corner) to see everything this site can do.'}}}</p>
        <p>{{{i18n 'The site is expected to live for about a week, and the mechanics are a bit like that site where you draw on a map, remember it? I liked it soooooo much.'}}}</p>
        <p>{{{i18n 'So this time we DRAW WITH PIXELS, LADIES AND GENTLEMEN.'}}}</p>
    </div>
</article>
<article data-id="canvas-rules" id="canvas-rules">
    <header>
        <h3 class="text-red">{{{i18n 'Canvas Rules'}}}</h3>
    </header>
    <div class="pad-wrapper" id="rules-content">
        <ol>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No content that is prohibited on Twitch;'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'Do not cover other people’s drawings - better move yours;'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'The canvas theme is open, draw whatever you want;'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'For any questions, please contact me (caffeine_lich);'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'Do not create a bunch of accounts, draw from just one;'}}}</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</article>
<article data-id="chat-rules" id="chat-rules">
    <header>
